                                "sense_id": "b9446b65-8b60-313e-a263-62da12eb6095",
                                "text": "Socrates was sentenced to death for his deviance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "134980b4-b58b-3d7f-8be9-79b59050bc47",
